        "text": "Fig. 1 shows three kinds of germ as a Basic 8 class saw them through the microscope in the science laboratory. All three are bacteria.\n\n\n\n*Fig. 1: Three germs as they appear under a microscope, lettered P, Q and R.*\n\n**(a)** Describe the **shape** of the bacteria labelled **P**, **Q** and **R** in Fig. 1.\n\n**(b)** Name **three** diseases of human beings that are caused by bacteria.\n\n**(c)** State **three** conditions that allow bacteria to multiply quickly in cooked food that has been left standing.\n\n---"
