        "text": "Your group is to build the circuit shown in Fig. 2 using a cell, a switch, a resistor, a capacitor and an LED.\n\n**(a)** Describe **four** steps you would follow to build and test the circuit.  **[4 marks]**\n\n**(b)** State what you would observe at the LED when the switch is closed, and when the switch is opened again after a few seconds.  **[2 marks]**\n\n**(c)** State **two** precautions your group should take while working with the components.  **[2 marks]**\n\n**(d)** The LED does not light at all when the switch is closed. State **two** possible faults in the circuit.  **[2 marks]**\n\n---"
