        "text": "Pupils of a Basic 8 class were asked to study the different kinds of mixtures found in their homes and in the school.\n\n**(a)** Define a mixture.  **[2 marks]**\n\n**(b)** State **two** differences between a mixture and a compound.  **[2 marks]**\n\n**(c)** Classify each of the following mixtures as **homogeneous** or **heterogeneous**:\n(i) air\n(ii) sand and water\n(iii) salt solution\n(iv) a bowl of groundnut and rice mixture  **[4 marks]**\n\n**(d)** For each of the mixtures in (c), state **one** method that can be used to separate it.  **[4 marks]**\n\n---"
